d Chris Mooney, head coach of the Richmond Spiders men's basketball team.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"\\\"His work ethic, athleticism, and court vision have made him a valuable asset to our program.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"We're lucky to have him on our team.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Data from the NCAA and the University of Richmond's athletic department supports Smith's involvement with the team.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"According to the NCAA's official website, Smith has appeared in over 100 games for the Spiders, averaging 10.5 points and 4.2 rebounds per game.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"Furthermore, a review of the team's roster and game statistics from the past three seasons confirms Smith's participation in numerous games, including several key matchups against conference rivals.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"\\\"Kevin's contributions to our team go beyond just his stats,\\\" said Richmond Spiders point guard, Jacob Gilyard.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"\\\"He's a leader on and off the court, and his positive energy is contagious.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"We're all better players because of him.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"When asked about his experience playing for the Spiders, Smith humbly credited his teammates and coaches for his success.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"\\\"I'm just grateful for the opportunity to play at this level,\\\" Smith said.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"\\\"My teammates and coaches have been amazing, and I'm proud to be a part of this program.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"With Smith's talent and dedication, the Richmond Spiders men's basketball team is poised for continued success in the NCAA Division I ranks.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"As the team gears up for the upcoming season, fans can expect to see Smith making a significant impact on the court.\"}]}"
